--TEST--
a cursor on the `throw` keyword names no symbol, so rename is refused
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $stock = 0;
if ($stock === 0) {
    thr<|>ow new RuntimeError('out of stock');
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=total
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
